==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Opals can be found by breaking [[Ore Deposit]]s and [[Rare Ore Deposit]]s. They are also sold by [[Kairo]], who travels along the [[Mountain Road]] between [[Foothill Stable]] and the [[Maw of Death Mountain]]. The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Opals as an ingredient for [[Light Yellow Dye]].

Opals are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Opal}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
Opals can be found primarily by breaking [[Ore Deposit]]s and [[Rare Ore Deposit]]. They also rarely appear by breaking [[Jar]]s on the [[Great Sky Island]]. When [[Fuse]]d to [[Weapon]]s, Opals increases their power by one. They also turn Weapons into [[Elemental Weapon]]s that launch orbs of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] with every swing. 

Opals are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Opal}}

